				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://shreyasb609.github.io/website-2.0/contact/</guid>
				<description>&lt;div class=&#34;page-hero&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;container&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;badge-pill-accent&#34;&gt;Get In Touch&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1&gt;Contact Us&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p class=&#34;lead&#34;&gt;We&#39;re here to answer questions, guide your tutoring search, and help you get started.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;main-content&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;container&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;row&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;col-md-8 col-md-offset-2&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p style=&#34;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;&#34;&gt;Have questions about our tutoring programs, matching process, or pricing? Reach out to us directly or send a message using the form below. Our team responds within &lt;strong&gt;24 hours&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p style=&#34;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;&#34;&gt;Whether you are a parent looking to schedule a consultation, a student preparing for upcoming exams, or an educator interested in joining our team, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
