			<item>
				<title>Frequently Asked Questions</title>
				<link>https://shreyasb609.github.io/website-2.0/faq/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://shreyasb609.github.io/website-2.0/faq/</guid>
				<description>&lt;div class=&#34;page-hero&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;container&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;badge-pill-accent&#34;&gt;Help Center&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1&gt;Frequently Asked Questions&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p class=&#34;lead&#34;&gt;Everything you need to know about Elevate Tutoring.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;main-content&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;container&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;row&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;col-md-8 col-md-offset-2&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;panel-group&#34; id=&#34;accordion&#34; role=&#34;tablist&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;panel panel-default&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;panel-heading&#34; role=&#34;tab&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 class=&#34;panel-title&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;a data-toggle=&#34;collapse&#34; data-parent=&#34;#accordion&#34; href=&#34;#faq1&#34; aria-expanded=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&#xA;How does the student-tutor matching process work?&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div id=&#34;faq1&#34; class=&#34;panel-collapse collapse in&#34; role=&#34;tabpanel&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;panel-body&#34;&gt;&#xA;After you submit a request, our academic advisors review your goals, current course syllabus, and learning preferences. We then pair you with an instructor whose academic background, teaching style, and schedule best match your needs, all within 24 hours.&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;panel panel-default&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;panel-heading&#34; role=&#34;tab&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 class=&#34;panel-title&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;a data-toggle=&#34;collapse&#34; data-parent=&#34;#accordion&#34; href=&#34;#faq2&#34; class=&#34;collapsed&#34;&gt;&#xA;Where do tutoring sessions take place?&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div id=&#34;faq2&#34; class=&#34;panel-collapse collapse&#34; role=&#34;tabpanel&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;panel-body&#34;&gt;&#xA;Most sessions are conducted online via HD video calls with collaborative digital whiteboards, real-time screen sharing, and saved lesson notes. In-person tutoring is also available depending on your location.&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;panel panel-default&#34; id=&#34;faq3&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;panel-heading&#34; role=&#34;tab&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 class=&#34;panel-title&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;a data-toggle=&#34;collapse&#34; data-parent=&#34;#accordion&#34; href=&#34;#faq3-body&#34; aria-expanded=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&#xA;What is the 100% Fit Guarantee?&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div id=&#34;faq3-body&#34; class=&#34;panel-collapse collapse in&#34; role=&#34;tabpanel&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;panel-body&#34;&gt;&#xA;If you or your child are not completely satisfied with your tutor after the first session, we will rematch you with a new instructor at no extra charge and credit your session. Your satisfaction is our priority.&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;panel panel-default&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;panel-heading&#34; role=&#34;tab&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 class=&#34;panel-title&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;a data-toggle=&#34;collapse&#34; data-parent=&#34;#accordion&#34; href=&#34;#faq4&#34; class=&#34;collapsed&#34;&gt;&#xA;What academic subjects and test prep do you cover?&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div id=&#34;faq4&#34; class=&#34;panel-collapse collapse&#34; role=&#34;tabpanel&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;panel-body&#34;&gt;&#xA;We cover K-12 Math (Pre-Algebra through Calculus BC), Sciences (Biology, Chemistry, Physics), Computer Science (Python, Java), Humanities, College Essays, and standardized test prep (SAT, ACT, AP Exams, PSAT, SSAT/ISEE).&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;panel panel-default&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;panel-heading&#34; role=&#34;tab&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 class=&#34;panel-title&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;a data-toggle=&#34;collapse&#34; data-parent=&#34;#accordion&#34; href=&#34;#faq5&#34; class=&#34;collapsed&#34;&gt;&#xA;How much do sessions cost?&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div id=&#34;faq5&#34; class=&#34;panel-collapse collapse&#34; role=&#34;tabpanel&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;panel-body&#34;&gt;&#xA;Pricing varies depending on subject complexity, tutor experience level, and session frequency. The initial consultation is always free. Contact us for a personalized quote; we are committed to offering competitive, transparent rates.&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;panel panel-default&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;panel-heading&#34; role=&#34;tab&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 class=&#34;panel-title&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;a data-toggle=&#34;collapse&#34; data-parent=&#34;#accordion&#34; href=&#34;#faq6&#34; class=&#34;collapsed&#34;&gt;&#xA;Can I switch tutors if I need to?&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div id=&#34;faq6&#34; class=&#34;panel-collapse collapse&#34; role=&#34;tabpanel&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;panel-body&#34;&gt;&#xA;Absolutely. We understand that the tutor-student relationship is key to success. If at any point you would like a different tutor, just let us know and we will arrange a new match without hesitation.&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;text-center&#34; style=&#34;margin-top:56px;padding:40px 32px;background:#F3F1EC;border:1px solid #EAE4D9;border-radius:12px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 style=&#34;margin-bottom:10px;&#34;&gt;Still have questions?&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;p style=&#34;margin-bottom:24px;&#34;&gt;Our team is happy to help. Reach out and we will respond within one business day.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Get Tutored</title>
				<link>https://shreyasb609.github.io/website-2.0/get-tutored/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://shreyasb609.github.io/website-2.0/get-tutored/</guid>
				<description>&lt;div class=&#34;page-hero&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;container&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;badge-pill-accent&#34;&gt;Free Consultation&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1&gt;Get Tutored&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p class=&#34;lead&#34;&gt;Tell us your goals, and we will match you with the perfect tutor within 24 hours.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;main-content&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;container&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;row&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;col-md-7&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;box&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 style=&#34;margin-bottom:6px;&#34;&gt;Student Intake Form&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p style=&#34;margin-bottom:28px;&#34;&gt;Fill out the form below and our academic team will reach out within &lt;strong&gt;24 hours&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;form action=&#34;https://formspree.io/f/YOUR_FORM_ID&#34; method=&#34;POST&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;row&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;col-sm-6&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;form-group&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;label for=&#34;student_name&#34;&gt;Student Name *&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;&lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; class=&#34;form-control&#34; id=&#34;student_name&#34; name=&#34;student_name&#34; placeholder=&#34;e.g. Alex Smith&#34; required&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;col-sm-6&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;form-group&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;label for=&#34;email&#34;&gt;Parent / Contact Email *&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;&lt;input type=&#34;email&#34; class=&#34;form-control&#34; id=&#34;email&#34; name=&#34;email&#34; placeholder=&#34;alex@example.com&#34; required&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;row&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;col-sm-6&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;form-group&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;label for=&#34;grade_level&#34;&gt;Grade Level&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;&lt;select class=&#34;form-control&#34; id=&#34;grade_level&#34; name=&#34;grade_level&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;option&gt;Middle School (Grades 6-8)&lt;/option&gt;&#xA;&lt;option selected&gt;High School (Grades 9-12)&lt;/option&gt;&#xA;&lt;option&gt;College / University&lt;/option&gt;&#xA;&lt;option&gt;Adult Learner&lt;/option&gt;&#xA;&lt;/select&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;col-sm-6&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;form-group&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;label for=&#34;format&#34;&gt;Preferred Format&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;&lt;select class=&#34;form-control&#34; id=&#34;format&#34; name=&#34;format&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;option selected&gt;Online (1-2 hrs / week)&lt;/option&gt;&#xA;&lt;option&gt;Online (3+ hrs / week intensive)&lt;/option&gt;&#xA;&lt;option&gt;In-Person (Local)&lt;/option&gt;&#xA;&lt;/select&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;form-group&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;label for=&#34;subjects&#34;&gt;Subject(s) Needed *&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;&lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; class=&#34;form-control&#34; id=&#34;subjects&#34; name=&#34;subjects&#34; placeholder=&#34;e.g. AP Calculus BC, SAT Math, Python, Physics&#34; required&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;form-group&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;label for=&#34;notes&#34;&gt;Academic Goals &amp;amp; Details&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;&lt;textarea id=&#34;notes&#34; class=&#34;form-control&#34; name=&#34;notes&#34; rows=&#34;4&#34; placeholder=&#34;Tell us about specific challenges, upcoming tests, or desired goals...&#34;&gt;&lt;/textarea&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;margin-top: 28px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;button type=&#34;submit&#34; class=&#34;btn btn-template-main btn-lg&#34; style=&#34;width:100%;justify-content:center;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;i class=&#34;fas fa-paper-plane&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt; Submit Tutor Request&#xA;&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;&lt;p style=&#34;text-align:center;margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:#78716C;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;i class=&#34;fas fa-lock&#34; style=&#34;font-size:11px;&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt; No commitment required. We respect your privacy.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Join as a Tutor</title>
				<link>https://shreyasb609.github.io/website-2.0/join/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://shreyasb609.github.io/website-2.0/join/</guid>
				<description>&lt;div class=&#34;page-hero&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;container&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;badge-pill-accent&#34;&gt;We&#39;re Hiring&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1&gt;Join as a Tutor&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p class=&#34;lead&#34;&gt;Make a real impact. Teach on your schedule, earn premium rates, and help students unlock their potential.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;main-content&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;container&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;row row-flex&#34; style=&#34;margin-bottom:56px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;col-md-4 col-sm-6&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;box-simple&#34; style=&#34;text-align:center;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;icon&#34;&gt;&lt;i class=&#34;fas fa-dollar-sign&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4&gt;Competitive Pay&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Premium hourly rates that reflect your subject mastery and teaching experience.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;col-md-4 col-sm-6&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;box-simple&#34; style=&#34;text-align:center;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;icon&#34;&gt;&lt;i class=&#34;fas fa-clock&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4&gt;Flexible Scheduling&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Set your own hours around classes, research, or other work commitments.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;col-md-4 col-sm-6&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;box-simple&#34; style=&#34;text-align:center;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;icon&#34;&gt;&lt;i class=&#34;fas fa-laptop&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4&gt;Remote &amp;amp; In-Person&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Teach online from anywhere, or meet students locally based on your preference.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;row&#34; style=&#34;margin-top:56px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;col-md-7&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;box&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 style=&#34;margin-bottom:6px;&#34;&gt;Tutor Application Form&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p style=&#34;margin-bottom:28px;&#34;&gt;Applications are reviewed on a rolling basis. We will be in touch within 2-3 business days.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Purpose &amp; What We Do</title>
				<link>https://shreyasb609.github.io/website-2.0/about/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://shreyasb609.github.io/website-2.0/about/</guid>
				<description>&lt;div class=&#34;page-hero&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;container&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;badge-pill-accent&#34;&gt;Our Story&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1&gt;Purpose &amp;amp; What We Do&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p class=&#34;lead&#34;&gt;Closing educational gaps and igniting lifelong curiosity, one student at a time.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;main-content&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;container&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;row&#34; style=&#34;margin-bottom: 72px;&#34; id=&#34;mission&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;col-md-5&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;divider-accent&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 style=&#34;letter-spacing:-0.03em;&#34;&gt;Our Mission&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p style=&#34;font-size:17px; line-height:1.8;&#34;&gt;At &lt;strong&gt;Elevate Tutoring&lt;/strong&gt;, we believe every student has untapped potential. Our mission is to close educational gaps, spark genuine curiosity, and build the problem-solving skills that last a lifetime.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p style=&#34;font-size:16px; line-height:1.8;&#34;&gt;We do this by pairing each student with an expert educator who understands not just the subject, but the way that specific student learns best.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
